Third-party model licenses (the code is MIT; the AI models you'll download are not):

- Coqui XTTS v2 — CPML, non-commercial only. Used here only for ja/ko (and
  optionally zh-cn). For commercial deployment, route those languages through
  Edge TTS as well, or swap in a commercially-licensed TTS.
- Qwen 2.5 — Tongyi Qianwen LICENSE AGREEMENT (Apache 2.0-like, with a
  >100M-users restriction). Permissive for schools.
- Whisper — MIT (OpenAI).
- Edge TTS — uses Microsoft Edge's online speech service; subject to
  Microsoft's terms of service.

Each AI model is the property of its respective rights holders.
